l":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 71.4%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.15"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":61.64,"default_fair_val":61.64,"premium_pct":-41.8,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":22.1,"pe_forward":19.4,"pb_trailing":3.9,"pb_forward":3.5,"div_yield":7.44,"ps_ratio":3.1,"fcf_to_ev":5.26,"fcf_to_mcap":7.99,"liab_to_assets":71.4,"cash_to_assets":0,"current_ratio":0.15,"roe":17.8,"roa":5.1,"moat":{"ticker":"UDR","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"UDR 在住宅房地產領域擁有一定的品牌知名度，尤其是在其運營的特定市場。然而，與消費品品牌相比，其品牌影響力在租戶選擇中的作用相對有限。租戶選擇更多基於地點、價格和便利性。雖然 UDR 的物業通常提供較好的設施和服務，這有助於維持租金水平，但其定價權並非絕對，仍需受市場供需和競爭對手的影響。其品牌價值更多體現在物業的品質和管理水平上，而非強勢的品牌溢價。","comment_en":"UDR possesses a degree of brand recognition within the residential real estate sector, particularly in its operating markets. However, compared to consumer brands, its brand influence on tenant selection is relatively limited. Tenant choices are more heavily driven by location, price, and convenience. While UDR properties often offer superior amenities and services, aiding in rent maintenance, its pricing power is not absolute and remains subject to market supply/demand and competitors. Its brand value is more reflective of property quality and management rather than a strong pricing premium."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"住宅房地產 REIT 的核心業務不涉及專利或技術壁壘。其運營主要受制於土地使用、建築規範、租賃法規等政府監管。這些法規雖然構成了一定的進入門檻，但並非專利或特許經營權那樣能帶來持續的競爭優勢。法規的變化可能對行業產生影響，但 UDR 並不能通過專利來保護其商業模式或獲取超額利潤。因此，此維度的護城河非常薄弱。","comment_en":"The core business of residential real estate REITs does not involve patents or technological barriers. Operations are primarily governed by land use, building codes, and leasing regulations. While these regulations form certain entry barriers, they do not provide sustained competitive advantages like patents or exclusive franchises. Regulatory changes can impact the industry, but UDR cannot protect its business model or earn excess profits through patents. Therefore, the moat in this dimension is very weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於租戶而言，搬家涉及時間、金錢和精力成本，這構成了 UDR 的一個重要護城河。一旦租戶入住 UDR 的物業，並對其居住體驗感到滿意，他們通常傾向於續租，而非頻繁尋找新住所。這種無形的轉換成本，加上 UDR 物業提供的穩定性和便利性，有助於提高客戶留存率和降低空置率。雖然不是技術性的鎖定，但這種生活方式的慣性是 REITs 的一個關鍵優勢。","comment_en":"For tenants, moving involves costs in time, money, and effort, forming a significant moat for UDR. Once tenants settle into a UDR property and are satisfied with their living experience, they tend to renew leases rather than frequently seeking new residences. These intangible switching costs, combined with the stability and convenience offered by UDR properties, contribute to higher customer retention and lower vacancy rates. While not a technical lock-in, this lifestyle inertia is a key advantage for REITs."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"住宅房地產 REIT 的業務模式本質上不具備網絡效應。每個物業的價值主要取決於其地理位置、設施和管理，而非用戶數量或用戶之間的互動。UDR 的不同物業之間不存在顯著的協同效應，一個社區的成功不會直接提升另一個社區的價值。因此，網絡效應在此維度上幾乎不存在，無法構成有效的護城河。","comment_en":"The business model of residential real estate REITs inherently lacks network effects. The value of each property primarily depends on its location, amenities, and management, not on the number of users or their interactions. There are no significant synergistic effects between UDR's different properties; the success of one community does not directly enhance the value of another. Consequently, network effects are virtually non-existent in this dimension and cannot form an effective moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型 REIT，UDR 在採購、融資和運營管理方面享有規模經濟帶來的成本優勢。其龐大的物業組合使其能夠與供應商協商更優惠的價格，並在資本市場上獲得更低的融資成本。此外，標準化的運營流程和專業化的管理團隊有助於提高效率，降低單位物業的管理費用。這種規模帶來的成本效益是其與小型房地產公司競爭時的一個重要優勢。","comment_en":"As a large REIT, UDR benefits from economies of scale in procurement, financing, and operational management. Its extensive property portfolio allows for negotiation of better prices with suppliers and access to lower financing costs in the capital markets. Furthermore, standardized operating procedures and a professional management team enhance efficiency, reducing per-property management expenses. This scale-driven cost efficiency is a significant advantage when competing with smaller real estate firms."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"UDR 的核心競爭力在於其對特定高增長、高需求市場的精準佈局。公司專注於美國主要都會區的優質地段，這些地區通常具有強勁的人口流入和就業增長，從而支撐了穩定的租賃需求。這些地理位置的稀缺性和優越性，加上對特定市場的深入了解和運營經驗，構成了其獨特的資產壁壘。獲取類似的優質地段的難度較高，為 UDR 提供了顯著的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"UDR's core competitive strength lies in its strategic positioning within specific high-growth, high-demand markets. The company focuses on prime locations in major U.S. metropolitan areas, which typically experience robust population inflows and job growth, supporting stable rental demand. The scarcity and desirability of these locations, coupled with deep market knowledge and operational experience, form its unique asset barrier. Acquiring similar prime locations is difficult, providing UDR with a significant competitive advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"UDR 在物業管理和運營效率方面表現出色。公司通過採用先進的技術和流程，優化租戶服務、維護響應時間和租金徵收。其專業化的管理團隊能夠有效地控制運營成本，並最大化物業的收入潛力。持續的資本投入用於升級物業設施和改善居住體驗，進一步鞏固了其在市場上的競爭力。這種高效的運營能力是 REITs 實現穩定現金流的關鍵。","comment_en":"UDR demonstrates excellence in property management and operational efficiency. The company utilizes advanced technologies and processes to optimize tenant services, maintenance response times, and rent collection. Its professional management team effectively controls operating costs and maximizes property revenue potential. Continuous capital investment in upgrading facilities and enhancing living experiences further solidifies its market competitiveness. This efficient operational capability is crucial for REITs to achieve stable cash flows."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"UDR 的管理層在資本配置方面展現出較強的紀律性和戰略眼光。公司歷史上通過精準的收購和開發，有效擴大了資產規模並提升了資產質量。同時，它也積極進行資產剝離，出售表現不佳或非核心的物業，以優化投資組合。股息支付穩定且具有增長潛力，同時也注重通過再投資來提升資產價值。這種平衡的資本配置策略有助於實現長期、可持續的股東回報。","comment_en":"UDR's management exhibits strong discipline and strategic vision in capital allocation. Historically, the company has effectively expanded its asset base and improved asset quality through precise acquisitions and development. Concurrently, it actively divests underperforming or non-core properties to optimize its portfolio. Dividend payments are stable with growth potential, alongside reinvestment to enhance asset value. This balanced capital allocation strategy contributes to achieving long-term, sustainable shareholder returns."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，UDR 通過提供高品質的居住體驗、優質的客戶服務和便利的設施，成功地實現了較高的客戶留存率。滿意的租戶更傾向於續租，這直接降低了公司的獲客成本和空置率。持續的物業維護和升級，以及積極響應租戶需求，都加強了客戶忠誠度。這種穩定的租戶基礎是 REITs 業務可預測性和盈利能力的重要保障。","comment_en":"As noted in M3, UDR achieves high customer retention by providing a high-quality living experience, excellent customer service, and convenient amenities. Satisfied tenants are more likely to renew leases, directly reducing customer acquisition costs and vacancy rates. Ongoing property maintenance and upgrades, along with proactive responses to tenant needs, strengthen customer loyalty. This stable tenant base is a crucial guarantee of the predictability and profitability of a REIT's business."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"住宅 REIT 的業務具有相對較強的持久性，因為住房是基本需求，不易受到經濟週期劇烈波動的影響。UDR 專注於優質地段和不斷升級的物業，使其能夠在不同經濟環境下保持相對穩定的租金收入和入住率。雖然經濟衰退可能導致租金增長放緩或入住率短期下降，但其核心資產的價值和長期需求預期使其能夠抵禦較長時間的經濟壓力，展現出良好的業務韌性。","comment_en":"The business of residential REITs possesses relatively strong durability, as housing is a fundamental need less susceptible to severe economic cycle fluctuations. UDR's focus on prime locations and continuously upgraded properties enables it to maintain relatively stable rental income and occupancy rates across different economic conditions. While recessions may slow rent growth or temporarily reduce occupancy, the value of its core assets and long-term demand expectations allow it to withstand prolonged economic pressures, demonstrating good business resilience."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"UDR 的護城河主要體現在其對美國主要都會區優質地段的獨特資產佔有（M6），以及由此衍生的規模經濟（M5）和高效的運營管理（M7）。租戶因搬家成本和對居住體驗的滿意度而產生的轉換成本（M3）和客戶忠誠度（M9）也構成了穩固的壁壘。管理層審慎的資本配置（M8）進一步增強了其長期價值創造能力。雖然缺乏專利或網絡效應（M2, M4），但其核心業務的持久性（M10）和品牌在特定市場的認可度（M1）使其成為一個具有特許經營性質的房地產資產組合，能夠在可預見的未來持續產生穩定的現金流。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"UDR's moat is primarily anchored in its unique asset ownership in prime U.S. metropolitan locations (M6), complemented by economies of scale (M5) and efficient operational management (M7). Tenant switching costs (M3) and loyalty stemming from satisfactory living experiences also form a solid barrier. Prudent capital allocation (M8) by management further enhances its long-term value creation. While lacking patents or network effects (M2, M4), the durability of its core business (M10) and brand recognition in specific markets (M1) position it as a portfolio of real estate assets with franchise-like qualities, capable of generating stable cash flows for the foreseeable future.","evidenceHash":"f1692eef3378f3e1ab5ed518a8bedce7e6a5b2e0f2e57c07d6d8ba76d8466920","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:24:37.317Z","evidenceHash":"f0218f4bf8629b728cf173d6e516783c632362f479ce6b02eb0d774a4f650b24"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:24:37.317Z","evidenceHash":"f0218f4bf8629b728cf173d6e516783c632362f479ce6b02eb0d774a4f650b24"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/UDR.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/UDR.png","website":"https://www.udr.com","ceo":"Thomas W. Toomey","full_time_employees":"1420","description":"UDR, Inc. (NYSE: UDR), a distinguished S&P 500 company, stands as a premier multifamily real estate investment trust. The company boasts a proven history of generating exceptional and reliable returns for its investors, achieving this through the astute management, acquisition, disposition, development, and redevelopment of appealing real estate properties situated in key U.S. markets. As of September 30, 2020, UDR's extensive portfolio included ownership or partial ownership in 51,649 apartment homes, with an additional 1,031 units currently under development. With over 48 years in operation, UDR has consistently delivered long-term value to its shareholders, provided superior service to its residents, and fostered a high-quality experience for its associates.","description_en":"UDR, Inc. (NYSE: UDR), a distinguished S&P 500 company, stands as a premier multifamily real estate investment trust. The company boasts a proven history of generating exceptional and reliable returns for its investors, achieving this through the astute management, acquisition, disposition, development, and redevelopment of appealing real estate properties situated in key U.S. markets. As of September 30, 2020, UDR's extensive portfolio included ownership or partial ownership in 51,649 apartment homes, with an additional 1,031 units currently under development. With over 48 years in operation, UDR has consistently delivered long-term value to its shareholders, provided superior service to its residents, and fostered a high-quality experience for its associates.","description_zh":"**UDR, Inc. (UDR) 業務營運精煉報告**\n\nUDR, Inc. (NYSE: UDR) 是一家領先的**多戶型不動產投資信託 (REIT)**，為標普 500 指數成分股。公司專注於美國主要市場的**優質公寓物業**，透過**審慎的營運管理、併購、處分、開發及再開發**，為投資人創造穩定且優異的回報。截至 2020 年 9 月 30 日，UDR 旗下擁有或部分持有共計 51,649 個公寓單元，另有 1,031 個單元正在開發中。\n\n憑藉超過 48 年的營運經驗，UDR 致力於為股東創造長期價值，同時提供**卓越的租戶服務**，並為員工營造**高品質的工作環境**。其核心業務模式為持有並管理具備長期增值潛力的多戶型住宅資產，並透過精準的市場分析與資產配置，持續優化投資組合表現。","address":"1745 Shea Center Drive","city":"Highlands Ranch","state":"CO","zip":"80129-1540","country":"US","phone":"720-283-6120","full_address":"1745 Shea Center Drive, Highlands Ranch, CO 80129-1540, US","range_52w":"32.94-42","year_high":42,"year_low":32.94,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":32.94,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Bragg David D.","title":"officer: SVP - Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":2134,"price":39.48,"total_val":0.08},{"date":"2026-06-08","name":"TOOMEY THOMAS W","title":"director, officer: Chairman, President and CEO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":80000,"price":39.25,"total_val":3.14},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"CATTANACH KATHERINE A","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":4044,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"CATTANACH KATHERINE A","title":"Officer / Director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"BENSON KEITH","title":"officer: SVP-Chief Legal Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":12330,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"BENSON KEITH","title":"officer: SVP-Chief Legal Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":2845,"price":38.17,"total_val":0.11},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"Lacy Michael D","title":"officer: SVP-COO","is_buy":null,"action":"D-Return","shares":49091,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"Lacy Michael D","title":"officer: SVP-COO","is_buy":null,"action":"D-Ret